<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77488" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάννῠχ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παννύχιος, ὗε δ᾽ ἄρα Ζεὺς
					πάννυχος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.458
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. λύχνος παρακαίεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.130
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				382
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1152
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lasting all the night</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί πάννυχον ὕπνον ἀωτεῖς</span>”
				<i>;</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.159
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. σελάνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					451
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄργια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					3.713
				</span></i>
			: neut. pl. as Adv., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάννυχα</span>
			<i>the livelong night</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				929
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				1.567.6
			</span></i> (Karanis, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>).</div>
